138
00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:22.890
But this was a skeleton crew and they went to New York.

139
00:08:23.550 --> 00:08:29.850
Yeah, we actually wrapped filming in Los Angeles on March 28th, 2007.

140
00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:37.330
They did not go to New York to pick up the Jim and Karen scenes until April 19th of 2007.

141
00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:41.390
So we had been wrapped for the season for a little while.

142
00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:43.050
